00:02:50.796 --> 00:02:52.630
- [ Gasping ]
- [ Shouting ]


00:02:53.924 --> 00:02:55.258
[ Groaning ]


00:02:55.342 --> 00:02:58.094
There's more
where that came from
if you want to keep going.


00:02:58.178 --> 00:03:00.304
Jesus, Glenn, chill out!
The guy's trying to help us!


00:03:00.430 --> 00:03:03.224
Why'd you go after
his nuts like that?
You're right! You're right!


00:03:03.308 --> 00:03:05.935
l lost my head a little, Major.
I'm sorry, man.


00:03:07.145 --> 00:03:08.187
