00:04:16.632 --> 00:04:18.591
Good. All right.


00:04:18.675 --> 00:04:20.843
We'll see you next week, okay?
Have a good night now.


00:04:20.928 --> 00:04:22.261
Be careful, all right?


00:04:22.346 --> 00:04:23.554
Get your shoes.


00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:25.848
[ Girl ]
Bye. Thank you.
[ Chattering ]


00:04:28.769 --> 00:04:30.728
[ Door Opens ]


00:04:35.067 --> 00:04:37.610
