00:04:40.364 --> 00:04:41.697
[ Groans ]


00:04:44.201 --> 00:04:45.743
[ Sighs ]


00:04:47.037 --> 00:04:51.415
[ Horns Honking ]
[ Siren Wailing, Echoing ]


00:05:05.138 --> 00:05:06.639
[ Gate Opens, Squeaks ]


00:05:07.599 --> 00:05:08.599
