00:05:29.788 --> 00:05:31.539
[ Sighs ]


00:05:35.836 --> 00:06:13.539
[ Groans ]


00:07:39.376 --> 00:07:41.168
[ Sighs ]


00:07:41.253 --> 00:07:43.838
Another 365, guys.


00:07:45.382 --> 00:07:47.633
And I couIdn't tell you
where the time has gone.


00:07:55.225 --> 00:07:57.434
Wish I could
trade places with you.


00:07:58.687 --> 00:08:00.020
[ Exhales ]


00:08:05.735 --> 00:08:07.236
To the team.


00:08:08.280 --> 00:08:09.613
[ Exhales ]


00:08:15.996 --> 00:08:17.496
[ Sniffles ]


00:08:31.761 --> 00:08:33.262
[ Glass Rests On TabIe ]


00:08:49.988 --> 00:08:51.614
[ Drawer Closes ]


00:08:57.120 --> 00:08:59.663
[ Clicks Tongue ]
Until next year.


00:08:59.789 --> 00:09:02.791
[ Water Running ]
dd [ Humming ]


00:09:05.295 --> 00:09:08.714
dd [ Whistling ]


00:09:08.798 --> 00:09:12.176
dd [ Humming ]


00:09:12.260 --> 00:09:15.304
dd [ Humming Continues ]


00:09:16.890 --> 00:09:19.975
dd [ Whistling ]


00:09:20.060 --> 00:09:21.268
