00:10:38.555 --> 00:10:39.722
[ Grunts ]


00:10:39.806 --> 00:10:41.807
Where the hell are
you people coming from?


00:10:41.891 --> 00:10:44.310
The passage is open.
The prophecy-


00:10:44.436 --> 00:10:46.145
