Whoa!


00:10:51.901 --> 00:10:54.278
[ Rumbling ]


00:10:54.362 --> 00:10:56.280
[ Sighs ]


00:10:57.574 --> 00:10:58.866
[ Screams ]
[ Knife Stabs ]


00:10:58.992 --> 00:11:00.909
[ Granger ]
No!
[ Grunting ]


00:11:02.412 --> 00:11:04.121
[ Grunting ]


00:11:06.666 --> 00:11:09.376
[ Weakly ]
The prophecy-
It's all that there is.


00:11:10.295 --> 00:11:11.962
[ Grunts ]


00:11:14.049 --> 00:11:15.674
