00:11:31.107 --> 00:11:35.486
[ Grunts ]


00:11:35.570 --> 00:11:36.779
The king's sorcerer.


00:11:39.407 --> 00:11:42.034
We have work to do-
posthaste.


00:11:42.118 --> 00:11:44.953
We must not be caught
outside the fortress walIs
in darkness.


00:11:48.291 --> 00:11:50.667
