00:11:50.752 --> 00:11:52.169
[ Man ]
Get him up.


00:11:52.253 --> 00:11:54.505
[ Groans ]


00:12:08.937 --> 00:12:10.604
[ Man ]
Open the gate!


00:12:24.327 --> 00:12:26.662
[ Men Shouting, Indistinct ]


00:12:28.206 --> 00:12:30.124
[ Man ] CIose the gate.
[ Man #2 ]
Close the gate!


00:12:30.208 --> 00:12:34.002
[ People Chattering,
Shouting ]


00:12:44.639 --> 00:12:47.099
l know you can't be here...


00:12:47.183 --> 00:12:48.809
alive.


00:12:48.893 --> 00:12:50.519
Quite right.


00:12:50.603 --> 00:12:52.938
[ Åxhale ]


00:12:53.022 --> 00:12:55.899
l have passed
from this world.


00:12:57.735 --> 00:13:00.571
Remember
who you're meant to be.


00:13:00.655 --> 00:13:04.366
Remember that you must
return to this place.


00:13:05.326 --> 00:13:08.704
lt was my prophecy
