00:13:16.171 --> 00:13:17.671
[ Grunts ]
[ Chattering ]


00:13:30.852 --> 00:13:33.979
From what I've heard,
you've had quite an adventure.


00:13:34.063 --> 00:13:35.397
[ Man ]
The king!


00:13:36.566 --> 00:13:38.317
You wilI stand when
