00:13:47.535 --> 00:13:49.411
Well, that's not cool.


00:13:50.455 --> 00:13:52.915
lndeed, it is warm.


00:13:52.999 --> 00:13:55.292
l mean, it's...


00:13:55.376 --> 00:13:57.211
