00:14:19.692 --> 00:14:22.778
My soldiers were to ensure
that you were not taken...


00:14:22.862 --> 00:14:26.073
by the Dark One
at the enchanted place.


00:14:26.157 --> 00:14:27.491
Dark One?


00:14:27.575 --> 00:14:29.952
The feIlow who followed you
