01:26:15.462 --> 01:26:17.922
[ Whistling ]


01:26:19.258 --> 01:26:21.759
[ Rumbling ]


01:26:23.178 --> 01:26:25.096
[ Panting ]


01:26:26.640 --> 01:26:29.100
My actions are either that of a fool...


01:26:29.184 --> 01:26:30.893
