01:26:30.978 --> 01:26:32.603
[ Grunts ]


01:26:35.232 --> 01:26:36.774
[ Groans ]


01:26:38.193 --> 01:26:39.402
Go!


01:26:44.741 --> 01:26:47.493
Only you can save your world!


01:26:48.996 --> 01:26:51.163
And I shaIl save mine.


01:26:51.248 --> 01:26:53.791
We may see each other again.


01:26:54.334 --> 01:27:13.769
[ Whooshing ]


01:27:14.813 --> 01:27:16.188
[ Groans ]


01:27:20.611 --> 01:27:22.278
[ Grunting, Groaning ]


01:27:31.914 --> 01:27:33.664
[ Grunts ]


01:27:34.374 --> 01:27:36.876
Aaah!
[ Groans ]


01:27:43.634 --> 01:27:45.301
[ Shouting ]


01:27:54.645 --> 01:27:57.605
l could have brought peace
to my time.


01:27:57.689 --> 01:27:59.190
Peace!


01:27:59.274 --> 01:28:00.858
[ Grunts ]


01:28:09.242 --> 01:28:10.952
[ Groans ]


01:28:23.840 --> 01:28:25.508
