01:29:33.410 --> 01:29:35.161
What is it you said?


01:29:37.122 --> 01:29:39.331
Perhaps in my dreams tonight.


01:29:39.416 --> 01:29:41.584
Perhaps another time.


01:29:43.045 --> 01:29:45.963
[ Sighs ]
Perhaps another time.


01:29:46.965 --> 01:29:48.466
[ Chuckles ]


01:29:54.306 --> 01:29:56.640
[ Whooshes ]


